# Docker build context filter for the repo root.
#
# There is exactly ONE Dockerfile in this repo (services/api/Dockerfile) and it
# is built with the REPO ROOT as its context — `storyforge.seed` and
# `storyforge.precompute` resolve `data/` as `Path(__file__).parents[3]/data`,
# and `data/seed/gpcs.csv` is a relative symlink into the decoder package
# (DEVIATIONS 1.4), so both trees have to be in one context. The web app is a
# DO static site built from source (docs/DEPLOY.md), so it has no image and
# therefore no ignore file of its own.
#
# Verify this file by inspecting a real context, never by reading it — export
# what the builder actually received and look at it:
#   printf 'FROM scratch\nCOPY . /\n' | \
#     docker build --no-cache -f - -o type=local,dest=/tmp/ctx .
#   find /tmp/ctx \( -name '.env' -o -name node_modules -o -name .venv \)

# --- secrets. First, loudest, and never conditional. -------------------------
# `services/api/.env` (mode 600) holds ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, CLERK_SECRET_KEY and
# LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY. Nothing in an image may ever read it; production values
# arrive as SECRET env vars from the platform (.do/app.yaml).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.pem
*.key
**/secrets/

# --- version control and agent/editor state ----------------------------------
.git
.git/**
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/
.context/
.gstack/
.gstack-worktrees/
.claude/
**/.DS_Store

# --- language runtimes that must be rebuilt, never copied --------------------
# A host .venv is macOS/arm64 with absolute paths baked into pyvenv.cfg; copying
# it into a linux image produces an interpreter that cannot start. The image
# builds its own from uv.lock.
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# --- test and dev material ---------------------------------------------------
# Tests are not shipped: they pull pytest/hypothesis/cmudict/wordfreq, none of
# which are runtime dependencies, and `make test` runs from a checkout.
services/api/tests/
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
reports/

# --- everything the API image has no use for ---------------------------------
apps/
packages/
docs/
scripts/
README.md
Makefile
docker-compose.yml
.do/
